them, ctypes' PyCData_NewGetBuffer."] [50 1 "// memoryview(o) of such an o is a view of that shape; its bytes are o's BytesLike, written through WritableBytes."] [55 1 "// shaperOf is o's BufferShaper (or its built-in value's), nil when o's buffer is plain bytes."] [66 1 "// viewOf is o's buffer described as a view (PyObject_GetBuffer): o itself when a memoryview, nil when no buffer."] [83 1 "// BufferFormatter is an exporter of a 1-D buffer whose items are not bytes (queue 304): its Py_buffer's format, a"] [84 1 "// native one (\"\" for 'B'), as array_buffer_getbuf gives an array's typecode."] [89 1 "// exporterFormat is the format of o's 1-D buffer (BufferFormatter's), \"\" for bytes."] [104 1 "// nativeChar is get_native_fmtchar of the view's format (\"B\" for a plain view's), \"\" when it is no native single"] [105 1 "// character (queue 304: memory_richcompare's fast unpacking)."] [118 1 "// flatItems are the view's items in C order (tolist's, flattened)."] [139 1 "// releasedErr is CHECK_RELEASED's error."] [144 1 "// tupleKey1D is memory_subscript's and memory_ass_sub's tuple keys of a 1-D view (queue 304): a tuple of one index"] [145 1 "// (is_multiindex, ptr_from_tuple) is that index; of none, of more, of slices (is_multislice) or of other keys an error."] [171 1 "// hasIndex is _PyIndex_Check: an int, or a type with __index__."] [179 1 "// packChecked is pack_single of v into dst (format f) with CHECK_RELEASED after the conversion (gh-92888, queue 304):"] [180 1 "// a value's __index__, __float__ or __bool__ that releases the view leaves its memory alone."] [193 1 "// shapeList is view->shape."] [201 1 "// structFmt reports whether the struct module unpacks f (struct_get_unpacker): its byte orders, counts and codes only."] [211 1 "// ndim is view->ndim."] [219 1 "// nativeFmt is adjust_fmt's get_native_fmtstr for a shaped view: its format as a native single character ('@'"] [220 1 "// dropped), else NotImplementedError (ctypes' \"<i\", \"T{...}\": the struct module's, not memoryview's)."] [229 1 "// shapedList is tolist of a shaped view's dimension d at byte offset off (tolist_rec)."] [231 30 "// unpack_single: the format's own size"] [233 34 "// an item past a buffer of size 0 (an incomplete structure's \"B\"): CPython reads its zeroed b_value"] [249 1 "// shapedGet is memory_subscript of a shaped view."] [282 18 "// init_slice: strides[0] *= step"] [288 2 "// an index (memory_item), a tuple of indices (memory_item_multi), a tuple of slices, else invalid"] [349 1 "// stride0 is a shaped view's first stride in bytes (view->strides[0])."] [361 1 "// shapedSetND is memory_ass_sub of a shaped view of more than one dimension (queue 263, a cast's): a full tuple of"] [362 1 "// indices packs one item (ptr_from_tuple, pack_single); an index, a shorter tuple or a slice is not implemented."] [413 1 "// packAt is pack_single of v into a shaped view's item at byte offset off: the byte formats (pyi's shaped views pack"] [414 1 "// no wider item yet)."] [416 18 "// queue 286: pack_single's wider formats"] [432 13 "// pack_single's byte formats: type_error_int, value_error_int"] [465 18 "// gh-92888 (queue 304): a key's or a value's conversion that released the view"] [472 1 "// mvPlainByte: the format is 'B' (or none, a plain view's), whose items the byte paths index."] [475 1 "// multiGet is memory_subscript of a 1-D view of a format wider than a byte (a cast's, unshaped; queue 286): an"] [476 1 "// index's item (unpack_single), a slice's view of the same format, its items step apart (init_slice)."] [515 1 "// multiSet is memory_ass_sub of a 1-D view of format f, items sz bytes wide, cnt of them, st bytes apart (queue 286):"] [516 1 "// an index packs one item (pack_single), a slice copies a view of the same structure (equiv_structure, copy_single)."] [584 1 "// mvPack is pack_single (Objects/memoryobject.c) of v into b, one item of native format f (queue 286): the integer"] [585 1 "// formats by __index__ (type_error_int, value