uct module's"] [822 31 "// 3.15.2's complexes: the struct module's F and D, native"] [855 62 "// queue 286: a strided slice of a cast view, item by item"] [871 1 "// BytesLike makes a memoryview a bytes-like object (asBytes): a copy of its bytes."] [885 4 "// a view of a view: the same buffer, start, length and stride (CPython's memory_from_buffer keeps the"] [886 4 "// strides, so a non-contiguous view stays one)"] [893 42 "// picklebuf_getbuf: the object's own buffer"] [907 4 "// the export of a class's __buffer__: its __release_buffer__ called when the last view goes"] [915 3 "// queue 304: the exporter's format (an array's typecode)"] [917 40 "// queue 260: the exporter's format, itemsize and shape"] [923 2 "// memory_hash (queue 249): a read-only byte view's hash is its bytes' (hash(b'..')), the exporter hashed first with"] [924 2 "// the view exported meanwhile (gh-142664: a re-entrant __hash__ that releases the view gets BufferError)"] [959 33 "// memory_repr"] [985 32 "// queue 304: is_multiindex, is_multislice"] [991 61 "// queue 286: a cast view's items (multiprocessing's Barrier: cast('i'))"] [1005 19 "// gh-92888: an __index__ that released the view"] [1017 2 "// item and slice assignment into a writable buffer (PY6d's REQUEST: _pyio's readinto, pickle's protocol 5"] [1018 2 "// bytearray); byte views only"] [1031 17 "// queue 260: a shaped view's items are the struct module's formats (memory_ass_sub's adjust_fmt)"] [1043 27 "// queue 263: a 0-dim view's one item (a cast to shape ())"] [1046 20 "// queue 286: a 1-D view of a wider format"] [1051 45 "// queue 304: is_multiindex, is_multislice"] [1056 62 "// queue 286: a cast view's items (multiprocessing's Barrier: cast('i'), '?', 'b', 'c')"] [1112 42 "// pack_single: a value of no int a TypeError, one out of range a ValueError"] [1118 3 "// BASE_INACCESSIBLE (queue 304): a released view equals itself only"] [1126 3 "// queue 260 (memory_richcompare): views of other shapes differ (equiv_shape), and a form